Package: tvpkgs
Version: 0.1.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Alienkrishn [Anon4You]
Depends: curl, tar, gzip, coreutils, grep
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/termuxvoid/tvpkg
Description: TermuxVoid package manager with a fuzzy TUI
 tvpkg (also available as tvp) is a wrapper around Termux's package
 manager, supporting APT and Pacman, with an interactive TUI and a
 fast command-line interface.
 This package installs the prebuilt binary from the termuxvoid/tvpkg
 GitHub release for the device architecture (no toolchain needed).
